*** Keywords ***
General_SiSo_Auto_IQ_data_capture_with_WEBEM_LSS
    [Documentation]
    ...  The purpose of this test case is to set Debug Trace to capture L1-IQ data.
    ...  During the test case remote snapshot (with LSS on fault detection) is collected and verified.
    ...  Logs are being verified by checking files' size and comparing them with the mandatory files list.
    ...  Alarms are verified in raw alarms history in snapshot between test start and snapshot collection time.
    ...  In case of configuration with more than one cell, L3 call should be performed only for tested cell.
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param int cell_id: (Mandatory): global cell ID of tested cell, e.g.: 1
    ...  :param list of dict dl_nr_subcell_list: (Optional) : dl nr subcell list required to configure L1 IQ Data Collection,
    ...                                                       each nr subcell element should be defined as dictionary
    ...                                                       and should contain following parameters: nrcellDN and subcellId, e.g.:
    ...                                                       [{"nrcellDN": "MRBTS-50610/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-1", "subcellId": 0}];
    ...                                                       if not provided then ul_nr_subcell_list is mandatory;
    ...  :param list of dict ul_nr_subcell_list: (Optional) : ul nr subcell list required to configure L1 IQ Data Collection,
    ...                                                       each nr subcell element should be defined as dictionary
    ...                                                       and should contain following parameters: nrcellDN and subcellId, e.g.:
    ...                                                       [{"nrcellDN": "MRBTS-50610/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-1", "subcellId": 0}];
    ...                                                       if not provided then dl_nr_subcell_list is mandatory;
    ...  :param dict throughputs: (Optional) : dict with throughput and deviation values for each cell, e.g.:
    ...                                        {'827736065': {'throughput': {'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                                                      'uplink': '15 Mbits/sec'},
    ...                                                       'deviation': '20%'}};
    ...                                        defaults to None.
    ...  :param int l3_call_duration: (Optional) : duration (in seconds) of L3 call data transfer; defaults to 180.
    ...  :param str protocol: (Optional) : data transfer protocol; defaults to 'udp'.
    ...  :param str udp_buffer: (Optional) : monitoring data buffer; defaults to '4M'.
    ...  :param bool tput_verification_via_btslog: (Optional) : True - throughput verification will be performed using btslog
    ...                                                         False - throuput verification will be performed using iperf; defaults to False
    ...  :param dict ue_network_modes: (Optional) : dictionary with pairs of UE Serial Number - desired network mode,
    ...                                             possible network modes: NR_only, LTE_only, NR_LTE (NR_LTE mode CAN NOT be used with any of the other
    ...                                             two in case of more than one UE); defaults to None (current modes set on UEs will be used),
    ...                                             e.g.: {"SN1234": "NR_only", "SN321": "NR_only}
    ...  :param dict ues_and_cells: (Optional) : dictionary with UE serial numbers and lists of configuration distnames of cells to which they
    ...                                          can be attached, defaults to None which means that all UEs will be attached to all cells.
    ...                                          When given, listed cells will be called in pairs with specified UEs, if there are more
    ...                                          cells on the setup that were not mentioned in the list, they will be called with all UEs, e.g.:
    ...                                          {"SN1234": ["MRBTS-50146/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-1", "MRBTS-50146/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-3"],
    ...                                          "SN5678": ["MRBTS-50146/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-5"]}
    ...  :param: list of str ignored_cells_on_preparation: (Optional) : SHOULD BE USED WITH `prepare_cells_to_call` set to True!
    ...                                                                 list of cells CONFIGURATION distnames that should be ignored during
    ...                                                                 L3 Call not called cells preparation procedure and not be blocked/barred;
    ...                                                                 defaults to None (all cells will be prepared).
    ...  :param int sfn: (Optional) : system frame number; defaults to 65535.
    ...  :param int slot: (Optional) : slot number; defaults to 0.
    ...  :param str capture_mode: (Optional) : capture mode, can be: ScheduleSynchronousStopOfOngoingContinuousCapture
    ...                                        or StartNewScheduledCapture; defaults to StartNewScheduledCapture.
    ...  :param bool capture_on_event: (Optional) : enables capturing triggered by an event; defaults to True.
    ...  :param bool capture_on_event_bb_ru: (Optional) : enables capturing triggered by an event for BBMOD and RMOD; defaults to True.
    ...  :param str profile: (Optional) : profile for IQ data capture; only applicable when "capture_on_event_bb_ru" is True;
    ...                                   each profile represents different captureMode; 
    ...                                   when "capture_on_event_bb_ru" is True and "capture_on_event" is True - event type profiles are allowed;
    ...                                   when "capture_on_event_bb_ru" is True and "capture_on_event" is False - blind type profiles are allowed;
    ...                                   e.g.:'UL_PROFILE_1'; defaults to: UL_PROFILE_1
    ...  :param str capture_ru_list: (Optional) : capture ru list for IQ data capture; only applicable when "capture_on_event_bb_ru" is True;
    ...                                           e.g.:
    ...                                           [{"targetRMOD": "MRBTS-3933/EQM_R-1/APEQM_R-1/RMOD_R-1",
    ...                                             "antennaList": [{"polarization": "PLUS_45", "antenna": ["ANT1"]}, {"polarization": "MINUS_45", "antenna": [1,2,3]}],
    ...                                             "captureActivityTimer": 2}]
    ...                                           targetRMOD suppports 4 types of DN:
    ...                                            - full configure runtime RMOD_R(MRBTS-3933/EQM_R-1/APEQM_R-1/RMOD_R-1)， 
    ...                                            - full RMOD_R（/MRBTS-1/RAT-1/RUNTIME_VIEW-1/MRBTS_R-1/EQM_R-1/APEQM_R-1/RMOD_R-1), 
    ...                                            - configure RMOD (MRBTS-3933/EQM-1/APEQM-1/RMOD-1),
    ...                                            - full RMOD_A（/MRBTS-1/RAT-1/BTS_L-1/BTS_CONF-1/NP-7/SCF-1/MRBTS_A-3933/EQM_A-1/APEQM_A-1/RMOD_A-1)
    ...  :param list of dict custom_faults_snapshot_triggers: (Optional) : list of dictionaries with faults details which will trigger remote snapshot collection;
    ...                                                                    e.g.: [{"faultNumber": 8101, "faultName": "Name", "triggerType": "onFaultDetection", "snapshotCoverageLevel": "Full"}];
    ...                                                                    defaults to: None (default alarms list will be used)
    ...  :param dict custom_debug_parameters: (Optional) : dictionaries with debug parameters to be set for suspicious events capture;
    ...                                                    key: domain name, value: list of dictionaries with parameter name and value;
    ...                                                            e.g.: {"NrUlPhy", [{"name": "phyEventEnable", "value": "9"}, 
    ...                                                                               {"name": "enableRespCapture", "value": "1"},
    ...                                                                               {"name": "enableRespCapture", "value": "5"}]};
    ...                                                            defaults to: None (default debug parameters will be used)
    ...  :param str persistency: (Optional) : persistency of debug parameters to be set; can be: Persistent, NotPersistent or OneReset;
    ...                                       defaults to NotPersistent.
    ...  :param list of dict mandatory_snapshot_l1_iq_data_files: (Optional) : list of mandatory L1 IQ data files that should be
    ...                                                                        in collected L1 IQ Data Snapshot logs; e.g.:
    ...                                                                        [{filename=TechLog_PSMLog_ctrl.bin, archive_name_regex=.*_124D_trbl_logs\.tgz$, internal_path_to_file=None},
    ...                                                                         {filename=TechLog_PSMLog_entries.bin, archive_name_regex=.*_124D_trbl_logs\.tgz$, internal_path_to_file=None},
    ...                                                                         {filename=^fcpTriggeredCapture.*\.bin$, archive_name_regex=.*l1radio_fcp_triggered_capture_thor\.tar\.gz$, internal_path_to_file=None}];
    ...                                                                        defaults to: None (default mandatory snapshot L1 IQ data files will be used)
    ...  :param int timeout: (Optional) : timeout (in seconds) for configuration of IQ Data Collection and remote snapshot collection; defaults to 120.
    [Arguments]                                 ${cell_id}
    ...                                         ${dl_nr_subcell_list}=${None}
    ...                                         ${ul_nr_subcell_list}=${None}
    ...                                         ${throughputs}=${None}
    ...                                         ${l3_call_duration}=300
    ...                                         ${protocol}=udp
    ...                                         ${udp_buffer}=4M
    ...                                         ${tput_verification_via_btslog}=${False}
    ...                                         ${ue_network_modes}=${None}
    ...                                         ${ues_and_cells}=${None}
    ...                                         ${ignored_cells_on_preparation}=${None}
    ...                                         ${sfn}=65535
    ...                                         ${slot}=0
    ...                                         ${capture_mode}=StartNewScheduledCapture
    ...                                         ${capture_on_event}=${True}
    ...                                         ${capture_on_event_bb_ru}=${True}
    ...                                         ${profile}=UL_PROFILE_1
    ...                                         ${capture_ru_list}=${None}
    ...                                         ${custom_faults_snapshot_triggers}=${None}
    ...                                         ${custom_debug_parameters}=${None}
    ...                                         ${persistency}=NotPersistent
    ...                                         ${mandatory_snapshot_l1_iq_data_files}=${None}
    ...                                         ${timeout}=120
    [Timeout]                                   24 hours

    ${snapshot_name}                            Set Variable
    ...                                         snapshot_l1_iq_data.zip
    ${mandatory_snapshot_l1_iq_data_files}      Private Get Mandatory Snapshot L1 IQ Data Files And Archives
    ...                                         mandatory_snapshot_l1_iq_data_files=${mandatory_snapshot_l1_iq_data_files}
    ${test_start_timestamp}                     utilities.get_datetime_with_utc_tz

    ${bts_type}=                                hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}                               connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${cell_dist_names}                          admin_info_model.get_dist_names_for_specific_cell
    ...                                         connection=${connection}
    ...                                         cell_type=nr
    ...                                         cell_id=${cell_id}
    @{cells_distnames_to_call}                  Create List
    ...                                         ${cell_dist_names["configuration"]}

    ${vm_credentials}                           hwpta_testline.get_bts_test_pc_credentials
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${vm_ip_address}                            Set variable
    ...                                         ${vm_credentials['host']}
    ${vm_username}                              Set variable
    ...                                         ${vm_credentials['user']}
    ${vm_password}                              vm.get_vm_password

    ${fault_snapshot_triggers}   ${list_of_fault_names}                 
    ...                                         Private Get Fault Snapshot Triggers
    ...                                         custom_faults=${custom_faults_snapshot_triggers}
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}

    Check If Any Subcell List Is Provided For L1 IQ Data Capture
    ...                                         dl_nr_subcell_list=${dl_nr_subcell_list}
    ...                                         ul_nr_subcell_list=${ul_nr_subcell_list}

    Robot Log Step                              Configuring LSS and Snapshot configuration...
    snapshot.configure_remote_snapshot_collection
    ...                                         connection=${connection}
    ...                                         destination=lss
    ...                                         lss_ipaddress=${vm_ip_address}
    ...                                         lss_port_number=22
    ...                                         lss_username=${vm_username}
    ...                                         lss_password=${vm_password}
    ...                                         activate_default_triggers=${False}
    ...                                         fault_snapshot_triggers=${fault_snapshot_triggers}
    ...                                         timeout=${timeout}

    Robot Log Step                              Configuring L1 IQ Data Collection...
    Configure L1 IQ Data Collection             connection=${connection}
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                         distname=${cell_dist_names["run_time"]}
    ...                                         dl_nr_subcell_list=${dl_nr_subcell_list}
    ...                                         ul_nr_subcell_list=${ul_nr_subcell_list}
    ...                                         capture_on_event=${capture_on_event}
    ...                                         capture_on_event_bb_ru=${capture_on_event_bb_ru}
    ...                                         profile=${profile}
    ...                                         capture_ru_list=${capture_ru_list}
    ...                                         timeout=${timeout}
    Robot Log Result                            L1 IQ Data Collection has been configured successfully.

    Robot Log Step                              Configuring BTS R&D Debug parameters...
    Private Configure Debug Parameters For IQ Data Test             
    ...                                         connection=${connection}
    ...                                         custom_debug_parameters=${custom_debug_parameters}
    ...                                         persistency=${persistency}
    Robot Log Result                            Debug parameters have been configured successfully.

    IF    ${throughputs}
        Robot Log Step                          Throughput is provided. Executing L3 Call for ${l3_call_duration}s duration...
        Execute L3 call                         duration=${l3_call_duration}s
        ...                                     throughputs=${throughputs}
        ...                                     protocol=${protocol}
        ...                                     cells_distnames=${cells_distnames_to_call}
        ...                                     udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
        ...                                     ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}
        ...                                     ues_and_cells=${ues_and_cells}
        ...                                     ignored_cells_on_preparation=${ignored_cells_on_preparation}
    END

    Private Download Automatically Collected Snapshot From LSS
    ...                                         snapshot_name=${snapshot_name}

    ${alarms_verification_end_timestamp}        utilities.get_datetime_with_utc_tz

    Robot Log Step                              Verifying L1 IQ Data in Snapshot logs...
    Verify L1 IQ Data In Snapshot               snapshot_dir_path=${logs_path}
    ...                                         snapshot_file_name=${snapshot_name}
    ...                                         mandatory_snapshot_l1_iq_data_files=${mandatory_snapshot_l1_iq_data_files}
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    Robot Log Result                            IQ Data in Snapshot logs has been verified.

    Robot Log Step                              Check if alarms were detected in raw alarms history in snapshot...
    FOR    ${fault}    IN    @{fault_snapshot_triggers}
        Verify If Alarm Was Active In IMS Alarm History Beetween Timestamps
        ...                                     start_timestamp=${test_start_timestamp}
        ...                                     end_timestamp=${alarms_verification_end_timestamp}
        ...                                     fault_id=${fault["faultNumber"]}
        ...                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    END
    Robot Log Result                            Alarms presence in raw alarms history in snapshot has been verified.

    [Teardown]                                  Private IQ Data Capture Teardown
    ...                                         fault_snapshot_triggers=${fault_snapshot_triggers}
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}


Private Get Fault Snapshot Triggers
    [Arguments]                                 ${custom_faults}
    ...                                         ${bts_type}

    @{list_of_fault_names}=                     Create List
    &{fault_info}                               Create Dictionary
    ...                                         faultNumber=${8101}
    ...                                         faultName=L1 IQ Data Suspicious Event
    ...                                         triggerType=onFaultDetection
    ...                                         snapshotCoverageLevel=Full
    @{fault_snapshot_triggers}                  Create List
    ...                                         ${fault_info}
    
    ${fault_snapshot_triggers}                  Set Variable If     ${custom_faults}
    ...                                         ${custom_faults}
    ...                                         ${fault_snapshot_triggers}

    FOR  ${fault_snapshot_trigger}  IN  @{fault_snapshot_triggers}
        Append To List                          ${list_of_fault_names}    
        ...                                     ${fault_snapshot_trigger["faultName"]}
        Remove From Dictionary                  ${fault_snapshot_trigger}    
        ...                                     faultName
    END
    Robot Log Step                              Prepared Fault Snapshot Triggers: ${fault_snapshot_triggers}

    Robot Log Step                              Allowing alarms for all faults ids...
    Private Allow Alarms For Fault Snapshot Triggers
    ...                                         fault_snapshot_triggers=${fault_snapshot_triggers}
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}

    [Return]                                    ${fault_snapshot_triggers}    ${list_of_fault_names}


Private Allow Alarms For Fault Snapshot Triggers
    [Arguments]                                 ${fault_snapshot_triggers}
    ...                                         ${bts_type}

    FOR  ${fault}  IN  @{fault_snapshot_triggers}
        Alarms.Allow Alarm                      fault_id=${fault["faultNumber"]}
        ...                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    END


Private Disallow Alarms For Fault Snapshot Triggers
    [Arguments]                                 ${fault_snapshot_triggers}
    ...                                         ${bts_type}

    FOR  ${fault}  IN  @{fault_snapshot_triggers}
        Alarms.Disallow Alarm                   fault_id=${fault["faultNumber"]}
        ...                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    END


Private Configure Debug Parameters For IQ Data Test
    [Arguments]                                 ${connection}
    ...                                         ${custom_debug_parameters}
    ...                                         ${persistency}=NotPersistent

    &{ul_phy_event_enable}                      Create Dictionary
    ...                                         name=phyEventEnable
    ...                                         value=9

    &{resp_capture_enable_option_1}             Create Dictionary
    ...                                         name=enableRespCapture
    ...                                         value=1

    &{resp_capture_enable_option_5}             Create Dictionary
    ...                                         name=enableRespCapture
    ...                                         value=5

    @{parameters}                               Create List
    ...                                         ${ul_phy_event_enable}
    ...                                         ${resp_capture_enable_option_1}
    ...                                         ${resp_capture_enable_option_5}

    ${debug_parameters}                         Create Dictionary
    ...                                         NrUlPhy=${parameters}

    ${debug_parameters}                         Set Variable If     ${custom_debug_parameters}
    ...                                         ${custom_debug_parameters}
    ...                                         ${debug_parameters}

    Robot Log Step                              Prepared Debug Parameters: ${debug_parameters}
    
    FOR    ${domain}    ${parameters}    IN ZIP    ${debug_parameters.keys()}    ${debug_parameters.values()}
        admin_info_model.set_multiple_rad_debug_parameters
        ...                                     connection=${connection}
        ...                                     domain_name=${domain}
        ...                                     rad_parameters=${parameters}
        ...                                     persistency=${persistency}
    END


Private Get Mandatory Snapshot L1 IQ Data Files And Archives
    [Arguments]                                 ${mandatory_snapshot_l1_iq_data_files}

    &{default_mandatory_snapshot_file_1}        Create Dictionary
    ...                                         filename=${None}
    ...                                         archive_name_regex=^BTS.*_.*4D_l1a_iqSnapshotBuffer\.bin\.xz
    ...                                         internal_path_to_file=${None}
    &{default_mandatory_snapshot_file_2}        Create Dictionary
    ...                                         filename=${None}
    ...                                         archive_name_regex=^BTS.*_.*_RMOD_L_.*_2011_l1radio_fcpTriggeredCapture_thor\.tar\.gz.*
    ...                                         internal_path_to_file=${None}

    @{default_mandatory_snapshot_l1_iq_data_files}
    ...                                         Create List
    ...                                         ${default_mandatory_snapshot_file_1}
    ...                                         ${default_mandatory_snapshot_file_2}

    ${mandatory_snapshot_l1_iq_data_files}      Set Variable If
    ...                                         '${mandatory_snapshot_l1_iq_data_files}'=='${None}'
    ...                                         ${default_mandatory_snapshot_l1_iq_data_files}
    ...                                         ${mandatory_snapshot_l1_iq_data_files}
    [Return]                                    ${mandatory_snapshot_l1_iq_data_files}


Private Download Automatically Collected Snapshot From LSS
    [Arguments]                                 ${snapshot_name}

    Robot Log Step                              Waiting for remote snapshot to be available on LSS...
    ${remote_snapshot_name}                     timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer
    ...                                         5min
    ...                                         10s
    ...                                         vm.verify_if_file_was_found
    ...                                         directory_path=/home/ute
    ...                                         filename_regex=^Snapshot.*
    Sleep                                       240s
    ...                                         reason=Waiting for snapshot to be fully downloaded...
    ${remote_snapshot_path}                     vm.make_archive
    ...                                         source_dir=/home/ute/${remote_snapshot_name}
    ...                                         output_filename=${remote_snapshot_name}
    vm.remove_dir_with_content                  dir_path=/home/ute/${remote_snapshot_name}
    Robot Log Step                              Copying remote snapshot to logs directory...
    vm.move_to_target_directory                 origin_path=${remote_snapshot_path}
    ...                                         target_path=${logs_path}/${snapshot_name}


Private IQ Data Capture Teardown
    [Arguments]                                 ${fault_snapshot_triggers}
    ...                                         ${bts_type}=GNB

    Robot Log Step                              Performing Site Reset To Reset Debug Parameters...
    Perform Site Reset And Wait On OnAir        bts_type=${bts_type}

    Private Disallow Alarms For Fault Snapshot Triggers
    ...                                         fault_snapshot_triggers=${fault_snapshot_triggers}
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
